# Java + Spring Boot Development Guide

## Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Runtime | Java 21+ |
| Framework | Spring Boot 3 |
| Build | Maven or Gradle |
| Validation | Jakarta Bean Validation |
| Data | Spring Data JPA |
| Security | Spring Security |
| Messaging | Spring Cloud Stream (Kafka, RabbitMQ) |
| Resilience | Resilience4j |
| Testing | JUnit 5, AssertJ, Mockito, WireMock |
| Logging | SLF4J, Logback, MDC |

## Rule Routing

Consult these rules based on what you are working on:

## Quick Reference

- Build/modify REST endpoint: `languages/java/controllers.mdc`, `languages/java/validation.mdc`, `languages/java/error-handling.mdc`
- Build service/business flow: `languages/java/cqrs.mdc`, `languages/java/bff-architecture.mdc`, `languages/java/testing.mdc`
- Data access updates: `languages/java/jpa.mdc`, `languages/java/aggregation.mdc`
- External integration and resilience: `languages/java/http-clients.mdc`, `languages/java/resilience.mdc`, `languages/java/logging.mdc`

